   286→    text: >-
   287→      Successfully implemented first meta-spec feature (meta manifest) in single iteration. Key
   288→      learning: Bootstrap data quality matters - invalid ULIDs in kynetic.meta.yaml caused test
   289→      failures that were confusing at first. Pattern emerged: schema-first development (Zod) →
   290→      parser functions → CLI commands → validation integration → tests. This sequence worked well
   291→      for incremental verification.
