   309→    text: >-
   310→      Test isolation issue: Integration tests in .tmp/ subdirectory pick up project's meta manifest
   311→      due to upward search in loadMetaManifest. This affects meta.test.ts and
   312→      agent-definitions.test.ts. Tests would pass if run from /tmp but fail from project .tmp/.
   313→      Consider: (1) env var to disable upward search in tests, (2) move test temp dirs to /tmp, or
   314→      (3) mock file system for tests.
