   358→  - _ulid: 01KF6YR3S568WY0VTK9W65HK3Y
   359→    text: >-
   360→      Test isolation issue: Integration tests for CLI commands (especially meta commands) are
   361→      modifying the actual project's files instead of isolated test directories. This happens
   362→      because kspec searches upward from cwd to find manifests, and tests run from within the
   363→      project tree. Need test infrastructure improvements: either mock file system, use temp
   364→      directories outside project tree, or add env var to override spec directory path. Affects
   365→      meta.test.ts and potentially other integration tests.
   366→    created_at: '2026-01-17T21:45:58.309Z'
