   409→  - _ulid: 01KF6ZJMH0JF4P03F7KEAG98CQ
   410→    text: >-
   411→      Spec granularity consideration: The @meta-commands spec defines 14 individual command
   412→      requirements (meta-show, meta-agents-cmd, etc), each as a separate requirement under the
   413→      feature. In practice, implementing meta commands is iterative - some commands share patterns,
   414→      some have dependencies. This creates friction when trying to match implementation granularity
   415→      to spec granularity. Could benefit from guidance on when to use fine-grained requirements vs
   416→      coarser feature-level specs.
   417→    created_at: '2026-01-17T22:00:27.424Z'
