   470→    text: >-
   471→      JSON patch validation approach: Used TaskInputSchema.shape to get known fields rather than
   472→      calling parse(). This allows checking field names without validating values. Alternative:
   473→      could validate full patch data with TaskInputSchema.partial() for type safety on values too.
   474→      Current approach is simpler but less type-safe.
