   481→  - _ulid: 01KF7060GJHK60S7M2BGF553VF
   482→    text: >-
   483→      Partial task completion strategy: For complex multi-part tasks, can deliver value
   484→      incrementally by committing foundational work even when not fully complete. Auto-CLI-docs
