   505→    text: >-
   506→      Commander.js options bug: When a command has an optional argument ([arg]), the options object
   507→      passed to .action() is empty. Workaround: parse flags directly from process.argv. Affects any
   508→      command using .option() with optional args. Consider filing upstream issue or finding better
   509→      workaround.
